extends base

block content
  h1 Welcome to Plete, #{firstName} 🚀
  p We're thrilled to have you join our community of finance enthusiasts. Your journey to financial freedom starts right here.
  p Plete is designed to give you total control over your money with minimal effort. Ready to dive in?
  
  table.btn(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
    tbody
      tr
        td(align='left')
          table(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
            tbody
              tr
                td
                  a(href=`${url}`, target='_blank') Start Managing Finances
                  
  p(style='margin-top: 32px; font-size: 14px;') Need a hand? Our support team is just an email away. We're here to help you succeed.
  p(style='font-weight: 600; color: #F8FAFC;') — The Plete Finance Team

